# Skip the intro, then reach a running Beginner Random freestyle quest at 800x600.
# Coordinates are guest pixels. Run with the kit's smoke host:
#
#   RECOMP_SCRIPT=$PWD/smoke/freestyle-beginner.script RECOMP_HOST_DUMP_DIR=... \
#   RECOMP_DDRAW_MODES=640x480x8,640x480x16,800x600x16 RECOMP_SMOKE_DRAWABLE=800x600 \
#   build/recomp/pop_smoke
#
# The settle before "Beginner Random" matters: a click 2-3 s after the
# Freestyle dialog opens starts a generation that throws the game's own
# GplException ("bad conversion to list&", a GplNull where a list was expected),
# which the runtime cannot unwind. With the two intro movies played and
# skipped first, 4.5 s threw in three runs of three and 9 s passed, so 9 s.
# Players of the original report random freestyle crashes too; see docs/analysis.md.
# Return skips both movies; these timings match smoke/intro.script.
wait 12000
key RETURN down
wait 100
key RETURN up
wait 3000
key RETURN down
wait 100
key RETURN up
wait 8000
click left 92 548
wait 4000
key RETURN down
wait 200
key RETURN up
wait 6000
click left 398 404
wait 3000
click left 398 580
wait 9000
click left 398 236
wait 8000
dump quest-8s
wait 12000
dump quest-20s
click left 400 300
wait 3000
dump quest-click
